Package: TransferSemi
Type: Package
Title: Transfer Learning for Semiparametric Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Anonymous", "Authors",
    email = "anonymous@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the transfer-learning estimators used by this
    repository for partially linear models, sufficient dimension reduction,
    and conditional average treatment effect analyses. Methods include
    parametric, nonparametric, and neural-network routines for combining
    information across multiple sites.
